e therein whatever they wish. Thus does Allāh reward the righteous -","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"16:32","t":"The ones whom the angels take in death, [being] good and pure; [the angels] will say, \"Peace be upon you. Enter Paradise for what you used to do.\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"16:33","t":"Do they [i.e., the disbelievers] await except that the angels should come to them or there comes the command of your Lord? Thus did those do before them. And Allāh wronged them not, but they had been wronging themselves.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"16:34","t":"So they were struck by the evil consequences of what they did and were enveloped by what they used to ridicule.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":34,"sd":null}],"juz":14,"hizb":27,"surahs":[16],"sajdah":false}